      <title>WAIC 2025：AI不只“打工人”，它是工业界的“全能王”！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/waic-2025ai-20250715174004752-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 17:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
